  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to solve the equation. Get your answer as a fraction in lowest terms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg align\u003d\"center\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_4_1_solvingequations_7_30/image010.gif\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
